/* Nepal Information Hub — Stock market › Valuation by sector.
   Hydropower (project-finance DCF per project, river baseline, GIS map, PPA tariffs, royalty, tax holiday, licence expiry,
   insurance coverage and disaster risk), banks and financial institutions (commercial, development, finance, microfinance:
   five-year projections under NRB rules, excess-return, DDM, justified P/B, peer multiples), non-life insurance
   (combined ratio, float, solvency), life insurance (embedded value from actuarial-report figures, appraisal value),
   trading and manufacturing (working-capital DCF, EV/EBITDA and P/E peers).
   Each sector reads the annual report (PDF / Excel; English, Preeti or Unicode Nepali) through the Annual reports
   parser, plus the auditor's report and (life insurers) the actuarial report. Depends on reports.js, fin-core.js, nepal-geo.js. */
